// One complete reference round from Implementation/PRS/tb/top/no_forks.
// All producer and consumer state machines run concurrently; no periodic stimulus pulses.
// Full 32-bit words, four-phase handshakes, illegal codes, stability, counts and final drain are checked.
// Golden packets and input cases are embedded verbatim from golden/data.act and input/*.txt.
// Match complete packets by destination/content and issued case, allowing arbitration order.
// Initial producer launches differ by 2*TICK per port; transfers remain concurrent.
